
  OpenVaultDB — user-owned, portable databases with pluggable engines

  USAGE

    ovdb [command] [--flags]

  COMMANDS

    add <collection path> <json | -> [--flags]  Add a record with a new id to a collection
    cd [path] [--flags]                         Move to a path inside the current database
    cloud [command] [--flags]                   Authenticate and manage OpenVaultDB Cloud access
    completion [command]                        Generate the autocompletion script for the specified shell
    config [command]                            Show or change OVDB settings
    databases [command] [--flags]               List databases mounted on a running OpenVaultDB server
    delete <path> [--flags]                     Delete one record
    demo [command]                              Try the built-in TODO demo: two lists your apps and AI agents share
    engines [--flags]                           List where OVDB can keep your data
    explore [command] [--flags]                 Choose where to explore your data: DataTug CLI or DataTug.app
    get <path> [--flags]                        Print one record
    help [command]                              Help about any command
    init [--flags]                              Create a database manifest
    install [name...] [--flags]                 List and install fleet CLIs relevant to ovdb
    list [path] [--flags]                       List collections, a collection's records, or show a record
    open [--flags]                              Sign in to the OVDB web console
    pwd [--flags]                               Print the current database, path and where they came from
    self-update [--flags]                       Update the installed ovdb binary to the latest release
    serve [--flags]                             Run the OpenVaultDB API server
    server [command]                            Start, stop and check the local OVDB server
    set <path> [<json> | -] [--flags]           Create or replace a record, or change named fields with --field
    skills [command]                            See and install the AI agent skills for OpenVaultDB
    status [--flags]                            Show the local OVDB setup: server, databases, demo, skills and usage statistics (starts nothing)
    telemetry [command]                         Show or change usage statistics (off unless you turn them on)
    token [command] [--flags]                   Manage scoped access tokens for apps and tools
    upgrade [name...] [--flags]                 Upgrade installed fleet CLIs, including ovdb itself
    use [database] [--flags]                    Choose the database this project works with (or show it)
    version [--flags]                           Print version, commit and build date

  FLAGS

    -h --help                                   Help for ovdb
    -v --version                                Version for ovdb

